.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader","models":[{"name":"minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","directory":"text_encoders"}]},"widgets_values":["minimax_music3_text_encoder_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","minimax","default"]},{"id":54,"type":"MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode","pos":[1310,525],"size":[500,750],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"showAdvanced":true,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":64},{"localized_name":"caption","name":"caption","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"caption"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"lyrics","name":"lyrics","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"lyrics"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":73},{"localized_name":"max_duration","name":"max_duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"max_duration"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg_scale","name":"cfg_scale","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg_scale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[65,68]},{"localized_name":"seconds","name":"seconds","type":"FLOAT","links":[66]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.31.0","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"},"widgets_values":["Global Metadata: Lo-fi hip-hop, chillhop. 78 BPM, D flat major, major scale with jazzy extensions. Laid-back and dreamy throughout, a gentle warm drift with a subtle late-night glow that deepens in the middle and dissolves softly at the end. Studying, raining-outside, headphones-on late-night listening. Bedroom production: muddy warm texture, heavy vinyl crackle, tape hiss and wow-flutter pitch wobble, low-passed dusty mix, soft-clipped drums, everything slightly detuned and cozy.\n\nVocal Details: Soft androgynous vocal, hushed half-sung half-spoken delivery, sitting low in the mix like another instrument, lazy behind-the-beat phrasing, gentle breathy timbre. Sparse murmured double-tracked harmonies, occasional wordless \"mmm\" and \"ooh\" hums drenched in tape delay and warm spring reverb. Long stretches with no vocals at all.\n\nArrangement: Dusty boom-bap drums with a soft thumping kick, cracked snare with lazy swing, brushed hi-hats, low round sub bass. Warm Rhodes piano chords with slow chorus wobble as the harmonic bed, mellow jazzy guitar licks answering the vocal lines, constant vinyl crackle as texture. Intro: rain and vinyl noise, solo Rhodes chords fading in, drums slipping in halfway. Verses: minimal — drums, bass, Rhodes, soft guitar fills between lines. Instrumental sections: guitar and Rhodes trade relaxed jazzy phrases over the beat, occasional muted trumpet ghost notes far in the background. Bridge: drums drop away to rain, crackle, and floating detuned Rhodes, then the beat eases back in. Outro: elements fade one by one until only vinyl crackle and a last unresolved Rhodes chord remain.","[Intro]\nMmm...\n(rain on the window)\nOoh...\n\n[Verse]\nMidnight and the canvas glows\nDragging little wires where the current flows\nType a quiet dream, let the sampler drift\nNoise into a picture, like the fog just lifts\nTwenty slow steps, I'm in no hurry now\nLatents turning colors and I don't know how\nEvery render's like a polaroid I found\nSoft focus memories, no sound\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Verse]\nQueue another frame, let the motion breathe\nPictures start to move like the falling leaves\nVideo drifting by at twenty-four\nLittle animations on my bedroom floor\nSeed after seed like the rain outside\nSome of them are keepers, some I let slide\nSave the ones that feel like a Sunday slow\nNode to node to node... and off we go\n\n[Chorus]\nMmm... let it render on\n(take your time, take your time)\nOoh... by the morning it'll all be done\n(one more queue, one more try)\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Bridge]\nRain keeps drawing pictures on the glass...\nMy machine keeps dreaming...\nNeither of us fast...\n\n[Chorus]\nMmm... let it render on\n(take your time, take your time)\nOoh... by the morning it'll all be done\n(one more queue, one more try)\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Outro]\nMmm...\n(node to node)\nOoh... goodnight",222,"fixed",60,1.7,50]},{"id":51,"type":"SeedNode","pos":[989.7557318745813,1028.6986449689343],"size":[270,90],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","links":[73,74]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.31.0","Node name for S&R":"SeedNode"},"widgets_values":[483589313558745,"randomize"]},{"id":55,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[369.2546121353894,534.2185344575454],"size":[380,210],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"凤希AI友情提示 使用前必看","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.5.2","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["模型或整合包下载：\n\nhttps://pan.quark.cn/s/a1213641f8c2#/list/share/5e75665b0a764d4d9a9adbd2ec4b71f7\n\nhttps://pan.xunlei.com/s/VOm0BR-N1g-SuFr_RceCmVKzA1?pwd=qnc3\n\n整合包安装视频：\n\nhttps://bilibili.com/video/BV1dmdvBYEjw/\n\n有问题或使用反馈或有需求进Q群：\n775649071\n\n我的配置信息：\nAMD R2600X、 4060 TI 16G ，32G内存，256G虚拟内存（不会配置的自己问AI、最好用M2的硬盘）"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":49,"type":"KSampler","pos":[1840.0789613560576,908.4171646711502],"size":[210,262],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":67},{"localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":68},{"localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":69},{"localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":70},{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":74},{"localized_name":"步数